      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是支持者的声音，对速度有所影响\n似乎也是不争的事实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f903d291212fc9a3eed5cefab0dfa90280f8256634f51eb895a7f2404ea131fe",
