    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65b65a0226292cf9b71f04d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此今晚也唯有收下──\n收下那一如既往地支持着我的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d769f2d7224982b5be5e3eac21dc721a617b7fbc2f18179ae0de688229b070",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
