    {
      "uid": "zhcn:584c95041c52c14cfe7156bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皇帝”鲁道夫象征\n终于开始迈向出道战了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71541ca69dfb65082ecf7146c87dd664e13260ab6a67a78c0d24c928fe8ee0dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c1d34f294f458ceae295e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个消息一眨眼，\n就传遍了业界──",
      "source_fingerprint": "39a8eb2880ae2896cdd83e675685e630c3c2bdc3d7b90a88b4e42140b7cd3519",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017100.json",
      "json_path": [
