      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57bbf2c4f8ce37dd8ed3dc68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "学园内外听到的讨论，\n都是对于“皇帝”的期望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7d4527823f61f9ff07b38a2664f065085411221af3c3f5fb3ba1bdcfcb84602",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59f839a67c65cabd840fee24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一般人面对这个状况，\n难免会备感压力。\n不过“皇帝”本人──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddf624684a1e6eab7aa93203994a997684a5c97106fb1d43472a902695cd4d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
