    {
      "uid": "zhcn:494b11f4febf44325f2cc4ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──“跟着会长的脚步准没错”。\n你们能够这么想，\n让我无比高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "034c0990a1d62c767f24ad15c53a452212af2815b027b9deea33d8da5f18e5db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
