      "uid": "zhcn:63b01927c447c3924a3294b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我答应你们，会勇往直前，\n不会辜负你们的信任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f575ae664a63630500d88a74cc90c8ca0d432c8b9216ce5d976a6b0b04c2c1e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
