    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd86bd430f45a898107f1e43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "话虽如此，现在的我还相当青涩。\n即使扬言要做出这番壮举，\n也只会被当成蛙鸣蝉噪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b80532cffc7a099e43d93b1e6fffcc2a2b56c1153050f40622b9adc2df5ba7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
